  "description": "Hairline-bordered two-column block on the legacy content (\"yellow\") theme. Left 30%: sticky sidebar with an \"In this article\" TOC (on the real pages every H2, section titles and sub-headings, is listed via tocFromHeadings), a Share row with three icon buttons and a dotted-texture CTA card with a yellow pill button. Right 70%: rich-text sections (title H2, then a sequence of paragraphs with **bold**/[[link]] spans, sub-heading H2s, spacer/empty paragraphs, centred or full-width figures and yellow-ruled blockquotes), followed by a dotted-texture quote card (quote, avatar, name, role). At 767 and below the sidebar moves under the article and the TOC is hidden.",
